body:
As a workaround, maybe try to replace the fancy C99 inits here: https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/blob/76fa4a492b812313d2036475c73e0997febf4c81/src/main/tools/process-tools.c#L119

with simple old-school C initialization:

``` c
struct itimerval itimer = {0};
itimer.it_value.tv_sec = (long)int_val;
itimer.it_value.tv_usec = (long)(fraction_val * 1e6);
```

and see it it works. Let us know if it does!
